<title>HONG KONG: AWT World sells luxury flat for HK$29 mln.</title>
<headline>AWT World sells luxury flat for HK$29 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air and seafreight forwarder AWT World Transport Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday its wholly-owned Charter Trade Ltd has agreed to sell a residential property to third party Mongarson Investments Ltd for HK$29 million.</p>
<p>AWT said a HK$5.0 million profit before expenses will be realised from sale of the property which is a flat at Hong Kong Parkview in Tai Tam, Hong Kong. The deal is expected to be completed on February 28, it said.</p>
<p>AWT shares was unchanged at HK$0.88 each in midday trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
